    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloomkeeper is a cooperative, poetic, and soothing game where you play as the Guardian, a protective spirit of the forest tasked with bringing life back to a barren and hostile land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Accompanied by the Pouics, adorable yet clumsy little creatures, you\u2019ll explore mysterious landscapes, discover unique biomes, and nurture life around you. Cultivate your green thumb to awaken the sleeping nature and revive a fragile ecosystem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session invites you to slow down, reflect... and laugh at the antics of your plant companions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether playing solo or cooperatively, Bloomkeeper celebrates stress-free, non-competitive gameplay with a touch of magic and plenty of warmth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: dryness spreads and must be contained, or you risk losing the game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative adventure for up to 4 players,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many biomes and ecosystems, from meadows and mushroom forests to mountains,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant, visually enchanting world,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle mechanics focused on exploration and growth,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and unpredictable creatures: the Pouics!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive and relaxing musical atmosphere,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of unexpected surprises</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloomkeeper is a cooperative, poetic, and soothing game where you play as the Guardian, a protective spirit of the forest tasked with bringing life back to a barren and hostile land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Accompanied by the Pouics, adorable yet clumsy little creatures, you\u2019ll explore mysterious landscapes, discover unique biomes, and nurture life around you. Cultivate your green thumb to awaken the sleeping nature and revive a fragile ecosystem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session invites you to slow down, reflect... and laugh at the antics of your plant companions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether playing solo or cooperatively, Bloomkeeper celebrates stress-free, non-competitive gameplay with a touch of magic and plenty of warmth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: dryness spreads and must be contained, or you risk losing the game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative adventure for up to 4 players,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many biomes and ecosystems, from meadows and mushroom forests to mountains,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant, visually enchanting world,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle mechanics focused on exploration and growth,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and unpredictable creatures: the Pouics!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive and relaxing musical atmosphere,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of unexpected surprises</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Spread nature and breathe life back into a world of ash by guiding the Pouics, naive and curious little creatures. They dream of reawakening the world, but they can\u2019t do it alone. Guide them, calm them, protect them and help them restore life to a forgotten land.",
